$string['settings:embed_dimensions'] = 'Bal\'ina Embedding';
$string['settings:embed_dimensions_desc'] = 'Bal\'ina vektara embedding, kunis bal\'ina moodeelichi dhugumaan dhiyeessu ta\'uu qaba. OpenAI text-embedding-3-small: 1536. nomic-embed-text: 768. Moodeelonni Voyage 256, 512, 1024 fi 2048 fudhatu (1024 uumamaan jiru gaaffii keessaa hafa); bal\'inni sirrii hin taane ergamuu mannaa hafa, kanaafuu callisaan bal\'ina uumamaa isa ati gaafatte mannaa argatta. voyage-4-large 2048 irratti qindaa\'ina safarame ti — gaaffiiwwan dhugaa irratti recall +14.0 percentage points, ji\'atti $4 gadi — akkasumas isa fudhachuun IRRA DEEBI\'II INDEEKSII GUUTUU barbaada, sababiin isaas retriever gaaffii chunks iddoo embedding biraa irraa dhufan waliin qabxii kennuu dida. Duraan dursii gatii kana jijjiiruu mannaa ceehumsa moodeelii embedding fuula indeeksii RAG irra jiru fayyadami.';
$string['settings:embed_model'] = 'Moodeelii Embedding';
