// v4.4.0: course-page CSP setting.
$string['settings:csp_course_pages_mode'] = 'Content-Security-Policy fuula koorsii';
$string['settings:csp_course_pages_mode_desc'] = 'Mataduree CSP filannoo irratti hundaa\'e kan fuula koorsii bakka widgetiin AI Course Assistant itti hojjetu irratti. <strong>Cufaa</strong>: mataduree hin jiru (durtii). <strong>Gabaasa qofa</strong>: <code>Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only</code> ergi — biraawzeroonni sarbama ni galmeessu garuu hin dhorkan. Yaalii daawwannaa torban tokkoof gaarii dha. <strong>Dirqisiisi</strong>: <code>Content-Security-Policy</code> ergi — biraawzeroonni maddawwan iframe tarree hayyamamaa ala jiran, fidannoo fi fe\'iinsa balaa qabu kaan ni dhorku. Dhiibbaa skiriptii barbaadame kamiyyuu kan qindaa\'ina saayitii HTML Dabalataa keessatti maxxanfame ittisuuf ni gargaara (taatee IBL AI / Raison 2026-04-29 irratti). Qaqqabdoota [[tutorshort]] irratti dhiibbaa hin qabu, isaan yeroo hunda CSP cimaa ergu.';
