$string['modelregistry:err_noeolsurface'] = 'Guyyaan dhuma jireenyaa fuula API isa itti labsame barbaada. Sooramuun fuula tokkoof labsame fuula biraa irratti hin hojjetu, guyyaan fuulli isaa hin galmoofne immoo akkamitti beeksisni jireenyaa moodeelii ati hin waamnee gara dhaadannoo dhaabbii sobaatti akka jijjiiramu isaati. Yoo bakka hundatti hojjetu \'any\' fayyadami.';
$string['modelregistry:field_eol_date'] = 'Guyyaa dhuma jireenyaa';
$string['modelregistry:field_eol_date_help'] = 'Guyyaa sooramuu yookiin cufamuu labsame, dhangii YYYY-MM-DD tiin. Yeroo dhumni jireenyaa hin labsamne duwwaa dhiisi — duwwaan hin labsamne jechuudha malee nagaa qaba jechuu miti. Akka guyyaa kaalaandarii UTC tti dubbifama malee akka naannoo yeroo keetiitti miti, kanaaf namni sarara kana dubbisu hundi torban wal fakkaataaf karoorfata.';
$string['modelregistry:field_eol_surface'] = 'Dhumni jireenyaa kan hojjetu';
$string['modelregistry:field_eol_surface_help'] = 'Guyyaan sun fuula API kamiif akka labsame: <code>gemini-developer-api</code>, <code>vertex-ai</code>, <code>openai-api</code>, <code>azure-openai</code>, <code>bedrock</code>, yookiin fuula hundaaf <code>any</code>. Yeroo guyyaan galfamu hundatti barbaachisa, kunis waraqaa qofa miti: gemini-2.5-flash 2026-10-16 irratti akka sooramu gabaafamee ture, kunis taatee jireenyaa Vertex AI ture malee Gemini Developer API sayitiin kun waamu miti. Fuulli sun yoo hin jiraanne, guyyaan sun moodeelii eessa illee hin deemne irratti dhaadannoo dhaabbii oomishaa kaasa. Fuulawwan sayitiin kun dhugumatti waamu Drift gatii jalatti tarreessi, kanaaf kanneen kan kee hin taane odeeffannoo qofa ta\'anii hafu.';
